library interface and command	as the Interfaces rows lay out	Content › Interfaces
pyproject values	as the Build, Metadata and Versioning rows lay out; depends on mtsv	Project
spec file	Markdown, one section per mapping rule	Project › Documentation
.jsonl line endings	as .mtsv and .json	Project › Repository › .gitattributes
